          "data": {
            "text/html": "<details open style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,0.25);border-left:4px solid #2e7d6b;border-radius:10px;padding:0.8rem 1rem;margin:0.45rem 0;background:rgba(127,127,127,0.03);\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:.5rem;\"><span class=\"_clt_acc_arrow\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:1.7em;flex:none;transition:transform .15s;\">\u25b6</span><span style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.55rem;margin:.1rem 0 .15rem;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:1.7em;height:1.7em;padding:0 .45em;border-radius:999px;background:#2e7d6b;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1;flex:none;\">\u2462</span><span style=\"font-size:1.06rem;font-weight:700;color:#2e7d6b;\">Population sizes</span></div><div style=\"color:#777;font-size:.82rem;margin:.05rem 0 0 2.25rem;\">Per age / risk-group population counts used as denominators.</div></span></summary><style>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}details[open]>summary>._clt_acc_arrow{transform:rotate(90deg);}</style><div style=\"margin-top:0.5rem;\"><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Population totals per age group are fetched for the chosen geography (US states and countries supported via epydemix), or loaded from a CSV for custom / per-subpopulation populations.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='TqIu-0' random-id='bcfd541f-861c-ff9d-6fd6-97795986961c'><marimo-radio data-initial-value='&quot;Fetch from geography&quot;' data-label='&quot;&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&gt;Population source&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;' data-options='[&quot;Fetch from geography&quot;,&quot;CSV file&quot;]' data-inline='false' data-disabled='false'></marimo-radio></marimo-ui-element><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Risk-group split</strong> \u2014 the fetched (age-only) population is split across risk groups by these fractions (renormalised to sum to 1):</span></span><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><marimo-ui-element object-id='TqIu-3' random-id='70c448e1-f1b9-076a-7a12-716caa26c1d0'><marimo-number data-initial-value='0.5' data-label='&quot;&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&gt;risk 0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;' data-start='0.0' data-stop='1.0' data-debounce='false' data-full-width='false' data-disabled='false'></marimo-number></marimo-ui-element><marimo-ui-element object-id='TqIu-4' random-id='2fd24d7a-78ec-1093-1a9e-3d867e110ddb'><marimo-number data-initial-value='0.5' data-label='&quot;&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&gt;risk 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;' data-start='0.0' data-stop='1.0' data-debounce='false' data-full-width='false' data-disabled='false'></marimo-number></marimo-ui-element></div><marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&gt;No population fetched yet \u2014 choose a geography and press &lt;strong&gt;Fetch contact matrices &amp;amp; population&lt;/strong&gt; above.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;' data-kind='&quot;info&quot;'></marimo-callout-output><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Population \u2014 SubpopA</strong> (total 250,000)</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='Pvdt-0' random-id='ffcc4ed7-0506-e4ee-c833-510e1cc34a15'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;risk_group&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;0&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;age0&#92;&quot;:41666.666666666664,&#92;&quot;age1&#92;&quot;:41666.666666666664,&#92;&quot;age2&#92;&quot;:41666.666666666664},{&#92;&quot;risk_group&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;1&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;age0&#92;&quot;:41666.666666666664,&#92;&quot;age1&#92;&quot;:41666.666666666664,&#92;&quot;age2&#92;&quot;:41666.666666666664},{&#92;&quot;risk_group&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;&#92;&#92;u03a3 all risk&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;age0&#92;&quot;:83333.33333333333,&#92;&quot;age1&#92;&quot;:83333.33333333333,&#92;&quot;age2&#92;&quot;:83333.33333333333}]&quot;' data-total-rows='3' data-total-columns='4' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-field-types='[[&quot;risk_group&quot;,[&quot;string&quot;,&quot;object&quot;]],[&quot;age0&quot;,[&quot;number&quot;,&quot;float64&quot;]],[&quot;age1&quot;,[&quot;number&quot;,&quot;float64&quot;]],[&quot;age2&quot;,[&quot;number&quot;,&quot;float64&quot;]]]' data-show-filters='true' data-show-download='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='false' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false' data-download-file-name='&quot;_cell_Pvdt_df&quot;'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Population \u2014 SubpopB</strong> (total 250,000)</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='Pvdt-1' random-id='fbac93c9-2c84-9fcb-a010-c1e35b1fec33'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;risk_group&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;0&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;age0&#92;&quot;